0000 to 1780704000000 declined from 2138.82 to 1368.42; the last three of that leg are wide bear bars (ranges 230.76, 237.00, 230.85) and the 1780704000000 bar closes 1568.55, well above its 1368.42 low.", "The 1780790400000 bar is a bull reversal bar: open 1568.55, high 1690.78, low 1563.52, close 1687.83, closing in its top quarter.", "About 65 bars (1781481600000-1787097599999) overlap two-sided between 1512.91 (low, 1782432000000) and 1974.46 (high, 1785110400000), with repeated failed pushes at 1944.72, 1954.36, 1959.37, 1974.46 and repeated holds near 1821.49/1821.69.", "The 1787097600000 bar is a very large bull bar (1905.63-2293.80, close 2252.16) that breaks above 1974.46; the 1787270400000 bar has the widest range in the window (2325.31-2771.00 = 445.69) and closes 2515.30, mid-range.", "The next 25 bars (1787356800000-1789516799999) overlap between 2357.18 (low, 1788307200000) and 2680.00 (high, 1789084800000), with most bars between roughly 2394 and 2558; the bar at 1789430400000 tests 2358.62, holding just above 2357.18.", "Six consecutive higher closes follow (1789516800000-1789948800000), ending with a large bull trend bar (2641.70-2850.00, close 2775.61) that closes above every prior high in the window.", "The final bar (1790035200000) is an inside bar (2716.01-2776.18) closing 2752.43, just below the prior close 2775.61 and below the 2850.00 high."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Sell climax into 1368.42: three consecutive wide bear bars (1780531200000-1780790399999) end the decline from the window open, closed by the bull reversal bar at 1780790400000 (close 1687.83 near its high).", "end_time_ms": 1780876799999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780531200000, "upper_boundary": null}, {"description": "Broad two-sided trading range after the reversal: about 65 bars overlapping between 1512.91 and 1974.46, with repeated failed breaks of both edges (1944.72/1954.36/1959.37/1974.46 on top; 1821.49/1821.69/1512.91 below) and heavy bar overlap.", "end_time_ms": 1787097599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1781481600000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike out of the long range: bar at 1787097600000 (1905.63-2293.80) breaks 1974.46, and two bars later the 1787270400000 bar reaches 2771.00 with a mid-range close after a 445.69 range (climactic-sized).", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Trading range after the spike: 25 overlapping bars between 2357.18 and 2680.00, most of them inside roughly 2394-2558; a 2680.00 spike on 1789084800000 closes back at 2514.72 and price returns to 2358.62 on 1789430400000.", "end_time_ms": 1789516799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Current bull leg: higher low at 2358.62 (1789430400000) held above the range low, then six consecutive higher closes and a large bull trend bar (1789948800000) to a new window high 2850.00; the last bar is an inside pause bar.", "end_time_ms": 1790121599999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789430400000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a close above 2850.00, or a pullback holding above the 2680.00-2700.00 breakout area followed by a new high, keeps the breakout-spike bull read.", "Failed breakout: a close back below 2557.46 (the 1787788800000 range high) puts price inside the 2357.18-2680.00 range and shifts the read toward trading-range.", "Loss of the higher low at 2357.18-2358.62 turns directional pressure from bull to at least balanced and makes 2771-2850.00 a possible failed-breakout high.", "Repeated overlapping bars with deepening pullbacks that stay below 2775-2850.00 would move the phase from breakout-spike toward channel or range."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790164799999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Bar 1789977600000 is a 191.94-point bull bar closing 126.85 below its 2850.00 high, a large upper tail consistent with a buy climax rather than clean continuation.", "Bars 1789992000000 through 1790164799999 overlap heavily and make no net progress (2754.31 to 2726.81), so the trend has stopped advancing for 12 bars.", "The last two bars are bear bars closing in the lower part of their ranges (2741.96 vs low 2737.35; 2726.81 vs low 2717.02).", "Two earlier upside spikes in this same window (2680.00 at bar 1789128000000 and 2609.02 at bar 1789416000000) failed and returned into a range.", "Within the 12-bar range, 2786.81 (bar 1790136000000) is a lower high versus 2804.59 (bar 1790020800000), a small lower-high sequence at the top of the range."], "evidence_for": ["Higher swing highs and higher swing lows from the 2358.62 low (1789488000000) to the 2850.00 high (1789977600000).", "Decisive breakout closes of 2578.60 (1789732800000) and 2636.28 (1789747200000) above the prior ~2544.63 band, with bars 93-108 holding above the breakout level.", "The consolidation low 2716.01 is about 137 points above the 2578.60 breakout close, so no bar has returned into the pre-breakout range; the breakout has follow-through.", "Bull bodies dominate the up leg: 2507.15 to 2578.60, 2579.97 to 2636.28, 2658.81 to 2723.15, and 2723.15 to 2754.31 (bar 1789992000000)."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed H4 bars, open_time 1788436800000 through close_time 1790164799999; first close 2506.79, last close 2726.81.", "Window low 2358.62 (bar open_time 1789488000000); window high 2850.00 (bar open_time 1