ter bar has exceeded it.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "2658.06", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850.00"}, {"description": "Tight 12-bar consolidation after the spike: bars 1789992000000 through 1790164799999 overlap between 2716.01 and 2804.59 with no net progress, and the final two bars are bear bars closing near their lows.", "end_time_ms": 1790164799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2716.01", "start_time_ms": 1789992000000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["A close above 2804.59 with follow-through above 2850.00 would confirm bull continuation and move the phase toward breakout-spike.", "A close below 2716.01 and then below 2658.06 would break the 12-bar range and argue for a transition to a deeper pullback or a larger trading range.", "Continued overlap between 2716.01 and 2804.59 keeps the current range phase and contained breakout mode intact.", "A lower high below 2786.81 followed by a strong bear bar closing near its low would create an MTR-like topping structure and weaken the bull read."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2557.24", "close_time_ms": 1789739999999, "high": "2567.43", "low": "2495.82", "open": "2500.73", "open_time_ms": 1789736400000, "volume": "2947078.83"}, {"close": "2578", "close_time_ms": 1789743599999, "high": "2579.15", "low": "2535.1", "open": "2564.99", "open_time_ms": 1789740000000, "volume": "2129890.799"}, {"close": "2578.6", "close_time_ms": 1789747199999, "high": "2585.5", "low": "2569.16", "open": "2578", "open_time_ms": 1789743600000, "volume": "2298367.627"}, {"close": "2596.45", "close_time_ms": 1789750799999, "high": "2605.57", "low": "2578.44", "open": "2579.97", "open_time_ms": 1789747200000, "volume": "2231312.238"}, {"close": "2605.5", "close_time_ms": 1789754399999, "high": "2606.24", "low": "2585.2", "open": "2596.45", "open_time_ms": 1789750800000,